base http://a/b/c/d;p?q
g          -> http://a/b/c/g
./g        -> http://a/b/c/g
g/         -> http://a/b/c/g/
/g         -> http://a/g
//g        -> http://g
?y         -> http://a/b/c/d;p?y
g?y        -> http://a/b/c/g?y
#s         -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q#s
g;x?y#s    -> http://a/b/c/g;x?y#s
(empty)    -> http://a/b/c/d;p?q
.          -> http://a/b/c/
../g       -> http://a/b/g
../../../g -> http://a/g
g:h        -> g:h
